{
    "uid": "healthbot-ops",
    "title": "HealthBot Operations \u2014 the monitor itself",
    "tags": [
        "healthbot",
        "ops"
    ],
    "schemaVersion": 39,
    "version": 1,
    "editable": true,
    "timezone": "browser",
    "refresh": "30s",
    "time": {
        "from": "now-3h",
        "to": "now"
    },
    "panels": [
        {
            "id": 1,
            "type": "stat",
            "title": "HealthBot",
            "datasource": {
                "type": "prometheus",
                "uid": "prometheus"
            },
            "gridPos": {
                "x": 0,
                "y": 0,
                "w": 4,
                "h": 4
            },
            "targets": [
                {
                    "datasource": {
                        "type": "prometheus",
                        "uid": "prometheus"
                    },
                    "editorMode": "code",
                    "expr": "clamp_max(count(healthbot_heartbeat_total), 1) or on() vector(0)",
                    "refId": "A",
                    "instant": true,
                    "range": false
                }
            ],
            "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                    "mappings": [
                        {
                            "type": "value",
                            "options": {
                                "0": {
                                    "text": "SILENT",
                                    "color": "red",
                                    "index": 0
                                },
                                "1": {
                                    "text": "RUNNING",
                                    "color": "green",
                                    "index": 1
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "special",
                            "options": {
                                "match": "null",
                                "result": {
                                    "text": "SILENT",
                                    "color": "red",
                                    "index": 90
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    ],
                    "noValue": "0",
                    "thresholds": {
                        "mode": "absolute",
                        "steps": [
                            {
                                "color": "red",
                                "value": null
                            },
                            {
                                "color": "green",
                                "value": 1
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                },
                "overrides": []
            },
            "description": "Whether any completed run is still reporting. The collector holds a run's metrics for 10 minutes, so at the 5-minute timer cadence this is RUNNING whenever the last two runs landed. Nothing reporting reads SILENT rather than blank.",
            "options": {
                "reduceOptions": {
                    "calcs": [
                        "lastNotNull"
                    ],
                    "fields": "",
                    "values": false
                },
                "textMode": "value",
                "colorMode": "background",
                "graphMode": "none",
                "justifyMode": "center",
                "wideLayout": true
            }
        },
        {
            "id": 2,
            "type": "stat",
            "title": "Telemetry pipeline",
            "datasource": {
                "type": "prometheus",
                "uid": "prometheus"
            },
            "gridPos": {
                "x": 4,
                "y": 0,
                "w": 4,
                "h": 4
            },
            "targets": [
                {
                    "datasource": {
                        "type": "prometheus",
                        "uid": "prometheus"
                    },
                    "editorMode": "code",
                    "expr": "up{job=\"otel-collector\"}",
                    "refId": "A",
                    "instant": true,
                    "range": false
                }
            ],
            "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                    "mappings": [
                        {
                            "type": "value",
                            "options": {
                                "0": {
                                    "text": "COLLECTOR DOWN",
                                    "color": "red",
                                    "index": 0
                                },
                                "1": {
                                    "text": "Collector up",
                                    "color": "green",
                                    "index": 1
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "special",
                            "options": {
                                "match": "null",
                                "result": {
                                    "text": "NO PROMETHEUS DATA",
                                    "color": "red",
                                    "index": 90
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    ],
                    "noValue": "0",
                    "thresholds": {
                        "mode": "absolute",
                        "steps": [
                            {
                                "color": "red",
                                "value": null
                            },
                            {
                                "color": "green",
                                "value": 1
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                },
                "overrides": []
            },
            "description": "Prometheus scraping the collector. When this is down every other panel on this dashboard is stale, however healthy it looks.",
            "options": {
                "reduceOptions": {
                    "calcs": [
                        "lastNotNull"
                    ],
                    "fields": "",
                    "values": false
                },
                "textMode": "value",
                "colorMode": "background",
                "graphMode": "none",
                "justifyMode": "center",
                "wideLayout": true
            }
        },
        {
            "id": 3,
            "type": "stat",
            "title": "Runs reporting",
            "datasource": {
                "type": "prometheus",
                "uid": "prometheus"
            },
            "gridPos": {
                "x": 8,
                "y": 0,
                "w": 4,
                "h": 4
            },
            "targets": [
                {
                    "datasource": {
                        "type": "prometheus",
                        "uid": "prometheus"
                    },
                    "editorMode": "code",
                    "expr": "count(healthbot_heartbeat_total) or on() vector(0)",
                    "refId": "A",
                    "instant": true,
                    "range": false
                }
            ],
            "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                    "mappings": [
                        {
                            "type": "value",
                            "options": {
                                "0": {
                                    "text": "NONE",
                                    "color": "red",
                                    "index": 0
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "special",
                            "options": {
                                "match": "null",
                                "result": {
                                    "text": "NONE",
                                    "color": "red",
                                    "index": 90
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    ],
                    "noValue": "0",
                    "thresholds": {
                        "mode": "absolute",
                        "steps": [
                            {
                                "color": "red",
                                "value": null
                            },
                            {
                                "color": "green",
                                "value": 1
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                },
                "overrides": []
            },
            "description": "How many runs are inside the collector's 10-minute retention. The bot is a oneshot: every run is a separate process and gets its own series, so at a 5-minute cadence a healthy value is 2 or 3. Zero means the timer stopped.",
            "options": {
                "reduceOptions": {
                    "calcs": [
                        "lastNotNull"
                    ],
                    "fields": "",
                    "values": false
                },
                "textMode": "value",
                "colorMode": "background",
                "graphMode": "none",
                "justifyMode": "center",
                "wideLayout": true
            }
        },
        {
            "id": 4,
            "type": "stat",
            "title": "Version reporting",
            "datasource": {
                "type": "prometheus",
                "uid": "prometheus"
            },
            "gridPos": {
                "x": 12,
                "y": 0,
                "w": 6,
                "h": 4
            },
            "targets": [
                {
                    "datasource": {
                        "type": "prometheus",
                        "uid": "prometheus"
                    },
                    "editorMode": "code",
                    "expr": "count by (service_version) (target_info) or label_replace(absent(target_info) * 0, \"service_version\", \"NOT REPORTING\", \"\", \"\")",
                    "refId": "A",
                    "legendFormat": "{{service_version}}",
                    "instant": true,
                    "range": false
                }
            ],
            "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                    "noValue": "NOT REPORTING",
                    "thresholds": {
                        "mode": "absolute",
                        "steps": [
                            {
                                "color": "red",
                                "value": null
                            },
                            {
                                "color": "text",
                                "value": 1
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    "color": {
                        "mode": "thresholds"
                    }
                },
                "overrides": []
            },
            "description": "The version the reporting runs identify themselves as. Two versions side by side means a rollout is in flight or a host was missed, which is the only reading this panel is for. The version HealthBot was *built* at is not emitted anywhere, so it cannot be compared against that here.",
            "options": {
                "reduceOptions": {
                    "calcs": [
                        "lastNotNull"
                    ],
                    "fields": "",
                    "values": false
                },
                "textMode": "name",
                "colorMode": "value",
                "graphMode": "none",
                "justifyMode": "center",
                "wideLayout": true
            }
        },
        {
            "id": 5,
            "type": "stat",
            "title": "Environment",
            "datasource": {
                "type": "prometheus",
                "uid": "prometheus"
            },
            "gridPos": {
                "x": 18,
                "y": 0,
                "w": 6,
                "h": 4
            },
            "targets": [
                {
                    "datasource": {
                        "type": "prometheus",
                        "uid": "prometheus"
                    },
                    "editorMode": "code",
                    "expr": "count by (deployment_environment) (target_info) or label_replace(absent(target_info) * 0, \"deployment_environment\", \"NOT REPORTING\", \"\", \"\")",
                    "refId": "A",
                    "legendFormat": "{{deployment_environment}}",
                    "instant": true,
                    "range": false
                }
            ],
            "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                    "noValue": "NOT REPORTING",
                    "thresholds": {
                        "mode": "absolute",
                        "steps": [
                            {
                                "color": "red",
                                "value": null
                            },
                            {
                                "color": "text",
                                "value": 1
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    "color": {
                        "mode": "thresholds"
                    }
                },
                "overrides": []
            },
            "description": "Which environment the reporting runs stamp on their telemetry. More than one value here means two deployments are feeding one collector.",
            "options": {
                "reduceOptions": {
                    "calcs": [
                        "lastNotNull"
                    ],
                    "fields": "",
                    "values": false
                },
                "textMode": "name",
                "colorMode": "value",
                "graphMode": "none",
                "justifyMode": "center",
                "wideLayout": true
            }
        },
        {
            "id": 6,
            "type": "bargauge",
            "title": "Is every check still reporting?",
            "datasource": {
                "type": "prometheus",
                "uid": "prometheus"
            },
            "gridPos": {
                "x": 0,
                "y": 4,
                "w": 12,
                "h": 7
            },
            "targets": [
                {
                    "datasource": {
                        "type": "prometheus",
                        "uid": "prometheus"
                    },
                    "editorMode": "code",
                    "expr": "clamp_max(count(healthbot_check_result_total{check=\"new_relic\"}), 1) or on() vector(0)",
                    "refId": "A",
                    "legendFormat": "New Relic",
                    "instant": true,
                    "range": false
                },
                {
                    "datasource": {
                        "type": "prometheus",
                        "uid": "prometheus"
                    },
                    "editorMode": "code",
                    "expr": "clamp_max(count(healthbot_check_result_total{check=\"aws_metrics\"}), 1) or on() vector(0)",
                    "refId": "B",
                    "legendFormat": "AWS metrics",
                    "instant": true,
                    "range": false
                },
                {
                    "datasource": {
                        "type": "prometheus",
                        "uid": "prometheus"
                    },
                    "editorMode": "code",
                    "expr": "clamp_max(count(healthbot_check_result_total{check=\"google_analytics\"}), 1) or on() vector(0)",
                    "refId": "C",
                    "legendFormat": "Google Analytics",
                    "instant": true,
                    "range": false
                },
                {
                    "datasource": {
                        "type": "prometheus",
                        "uid": "prometheus"
                    },
                    "editorMode": "code",
                    "expr": "clamp_max(count(healthbot_check_result_total{check=\"checkout\"}), 1) or on() vector(0)",
                    "refId": "D",
                    "legendFormat": "Checkout journey",
                    "instant": true,
                    "range": false
                },
                {
                    "datasource": {
                        "type": "prometheus",
                        "uid": "prometheus"
                    },
                    "editorMode": "code",
                    "expr": "clamp_max(count(healthbot_check_result_total{check=\"pings\"}), 1) or on() vector(0)",
                    "refId": "E",
                    "legendFormat": "Canary pings",
                    "instant": true,
                    "range": false
                }
            ],
            "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                    "mappings": [
                        {
                            "type": "value",
                            "options": {
                                "0": {
                                    "text": "NOT REPORTING",
                                    "color": "red",
                                    "index": 0
                                },
                                "1": {
                                    "text": "Reporting",
                                    "color": "green",
                                    "index": 1
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "special",
                            "options": {
                                "match": "null",
                                "result": {
                                    "text": "NOT REPORTING",
                                    "color": "red",
                                    "index": 90
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    ],
                    "noValue": "0",
                    "min": 0,
                    "max": 1,
                    "thresholds": {
                        "mode": "absolute",
                        "steps": [
                            {
                                "color": "red",
                                "value": null
                            },
                            {
                                "color": "green",
                                "value": 1
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                },
                "overrides": []
            },
            "description": "A check that stopped running looks exactly like a check that is passing, unless something names the checks that ought to be there. Nothing emits that list, so it is enumerated here: one row per check the run performs. The answer is yes or no and is drawn that way \u2014 a half-full bar would invite reading a magnitude into a question that has none.",
            "options": {
                "displayMode": "basic",
                "orientation": "horizontal",
                "reduceOptions": {
                    "calcs": [
                        "lastNotNull"
                    ],
                    "fields": "",
                    "values": false
                },
                "showUnfilled": true,
                "valueMode": "text"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": 7,
            "type": "bargauge",
            "title": "Check outcomes, by state",
            "datasource": {
                "type": "prometheus",
                "uid": "prometheus"
            },
            "gridPos": {
                "x": 12,
                "y": 4,
                "w": 12,
                "h": 7
            },
            "targets": [
                {
                    "datasource": {
                        "type": "prometheus",
                        "uid": "prometheus"
                    },
                    "editorMode": "code",
                    "expr": "sum by (check, status) (healthbot_check_result_total)",
                    "refId": "A",
                    "legendFormat": "{{check}} \u00b7 {{status}}",
                    "instant": true,
                    "range": false
                }
            ],
            "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                    "min": 0,
                    "noValue": "No check has reported an outcome",
                    "thresholds": {
                        "mode": "absolute",
                        "steps": [
                            {
                                "color": "text",
                                "value": null
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    "color": {
                        "mode": "fixed",
                        "fixedColor": "text"
                    }
                },
                "overrides": [
                    {
                        "matcher": {
                            "id": "byRegexp",
                            "options": ".*\u00b7 pass"
                        },
                        "properties": [
                            {
                                "id": "color",
                                "value": {
                                    "mode": "fixed",
                                    "fixedColor": "green"
                                }
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "matcher": {
                            "id": "byRegexp",
                            "options": ".*\u00b7 fail"
                        },
                        "properties": [
                            {
                                "id": "color",
                                "value": {
                                    "mode": "fixed",
                                    "fixedColor": "orange"
                                }
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "matcher": {
                            "id": "byRegexp",
                            "options": ".*\u00b7 error"
                        },
                        "properties": [
                            {
                                "id": "color",
                                "value": {
                                    "mode": "fixed",
                                    "fixedColor": "red"
                                }
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            },
            "description": "Runs recorded per check and state. 'fail' is the store failing a check; 'error' is HealthBot throwing while running one, which is the bot's own fault. The check names are left as the code spells them, because this panel reads whatever labels arrive: a check added in code appears here without a dashboard change.",
            "options": {
                "displayMode": "basic",
                "orientation": "horizontal",
                "reduceOptions": {
                    "calcs": [
                        "lastNotNull"
                    ],
                    "fields": "",
                    "values": false
                },
                "showUnfilled": true,
                "valueMode": "text"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": 8,
            "type": "timeseries",
            "title": "Checks that threw \u2014 HealthBot's own fault",
            "datasource": {
                "type": "prometheus",
                "uid": "prometheus"
            },
            "gridPos": {
                "x": 0,
                "y": 11,
                "w": 8,
                "h": 7
            },
            "targets": [
                {
                    "datasource": {
                        "type": "prometheus",
                        "uid": "prometheus"
                    },
                    "editorMode": "code",
                    "expr": "sum by (check) (healthbot_check_result_total{status=\"error\"})",
                    "refId": "A",
                    "legendFormat": "{{check}}"
                }
            ],
            "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                    "min": 0,
                    "custom": {
                        "drawStyle": "line",
                        "lineWidth": 2,
                        "fillOpacity": 10,
                        "showPoints": "auto",
                        "spanNulls": false
                    },
                    "color": {
                        "mode": "fixed",
                        "fixedColor": "red"
                    },
                    "noValue": "Nothing reported in this window"
                },
                "overrides": []
            },
            "description": "An 'error' is an exception inside HealthBot, not a verdict about the store. Flat at zero is the healthy state; any step up is a bug here rather than an outage there."
        },
        {
            "id": 9,
            "type": "timeseries",
            "title": "Run outcomes",
            "datasource": {
                "type": "prometheus",
                "uid": "prometheus"
            },
            "gridPos": {
                "x": 8,
                "y": 11,
                "w": 8,
                "h": 7
            },
            "targets": [
                {
                    "datasource": {
                        "type": "prometheus",
                        "uid": "prometheus"
                    },
                    "editorMode": "code",
                    "expr": "sum by (outcome) (healthbot_heartbeat_total)",
                    "refId": "A",
                    "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}"
                }
            ],
            "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                    "min": 0,
                    "custom": {
                        "drawStyle": "line",
                        "lineWidth": 2,
                        "fillOpacity": 10,
                        "showPoints": "auto",
                        "spanNulls": false
                    },
                    "noValue": "Nothing reported in this window"
                },
                "overrides": [
                    {
                        "matcher": {
                            "id": "byName",
                            "options": "success"
                        },
                        "properties": [
                            {
                                "id": "color",
                                "value": {
                                    "mode": "fixed",
                                    "fixedColor": "green"
                                }
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "matcher": {
                            "id": "byName",
                            "options": "error"
                        },
                        "properties": [
                            {
                                "id": "color",
                                "value": {
                                    "mode": "fixed",
                                    "fixedColor": "red"
                                }
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            },
            "description": "One tick per completed run, split by whether the run finished or died. A line that stops climbing is the timer having stopped firing."
        },
        {
            "id": 10,
            "type": "gauge",
            "title": "Mean run duration against the 300s systemd budget",
            "datasource": {
                "type": "prometheus",
                "uid": "prometheus"
            },
            "gridPos": {
                "x": 16,
                "y": 11,
                "w": 8,
                "h": 7
            },
            "targets": [
                {
                    "datasource": {
                        "type": "prometheus",
                        "uid": "prometheus"
                    },
                    "editorMode": "code",
                    "expr": "sum(healthbot_run_duration_seconds_sum) / sum(healthbot_run_duration_seconds_count)",
                    "refId": "A",
                    "legendFormat": "mean run",
                    "instant": true,
                    "range": false
                }
            ],
            "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {
                    "min": 0,
                    "max": 300,
                    "unit": "s",
                    "decimals": 2,
                    "noValue": "No run has reported",
                    "thresholds": {
                        "mode": "absolute",
                        "steps": [
                            {
                                "color": "green",
                                "value": null
                            },
                            {
                                "color": "yellow",
                                "value": 240
                            },
                            {
                                "color": "red",
                                "value": 300
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                },
                "overrides": []
            },
            "description": "The unit sets TimeoutStartSec=300, so a run past 300s is killed and recorded as a failure with the store blamed for it. The scale is that budget, so the headroom is visible without holding 300 in your head. The slowest single run cannot be shown: the histogram's first bucket boundary is 5s, so every run here is only known to be under 5 seconds.",
            "options": {
                "reduceOptions": {
                    "calcs": [
                        "lastNotNull"
                    ],
                    "fields": "",
                    "values": false
                },
                "showThresholdLabels": true,
                "showThresholdMarkers": true
            }
        },
        {
            "id": 11,
            "type": "text",
            "title": "Wanted on this dashboard and not emitted",
            "gridPos": {
                "x": 0,
                "y": 18,
                "w": 24,
                "h": 12
            },
            "options": {
                "mode": "markdown",
                "content": "A control that is simply missing cannot be told apart from a thing that was never built. These four are missing, and each names the change that would fill it.\n\n| Wanted | Why it is not here | The change that would emit it |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **Configuration age** | No instrument exists. `config_files.py` reads `site.yml` and `slo.yml` through a cache and never records when either was last written | A gauge set to the config file's mtime, one series per file |\n| **Secret age** | `SecretsManager` fetches the secret and discards the metadata. Nothing records a rotation date | A gauge set to the secret's `LastChangedDate`, which the AWS response already carries |\n| **Version built** | `target_info` carries the version the process is *running*. Nothing emits the version that was *built*, so the two cannot be compared | A build gauge from CI, or the deploy record carrying the sha into a metric rather than only into the DORA journal |\n| **Timer health** | No systemd metrics reach this stack. Cadence is inferred from heartbeats alone, which is why the panels above talk about runs reporting rather than timer state | A node exporter with the systemd collector, or the unit writing its own result into a textfile |\n\n**The check list above is the fifth.** Absence of a check can only be detected against an expected set, and nothing emits one. Recording every configured check with a zero at startup would make it data instead of a hardcoded list here."
            },
            "transparent": false
        }
    ]
}
